    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Questions, comments? call 1-888-334-5389 M-F 9AM-5PM ET www.vitafusion.com\r\nDiscard, seal, empty & replace cap\r\nBottle not recyclable unless label removed\r\nPlastic bottle plastic label\r\nhow2recycle.info\r\nScan me"
