    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Vitafusion Multi 9 + Immune has 2-in-1 benefits and flavors. Each bi-layer gummy provides a daily multivitamin plus immune support with Vitamin C and Zinc. And you will enjoy the Tangerine and Strawberry flavor combination. They are twice as fun!\r\n\r\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formulation re: Does NOT Contain",
      "notes": "No artificial flavors or sweeteners\r\nNo gluten\r\nNo high fructose corn syrup\r\nNo dairy\r\nNo synthetic FD&C dyes"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Growing communities with Fruitful Planting\r\nWe believe in holistic wellness and realize it\u2019s more than just taking vitamins. That\u2019s why we support the Fruit Tree Planting Foundation and together have planted more than 200,000 fruit trees in underserved communities.\r\nJoint our mission vitafusion.com"
    },
